      description 'Seatbelt\'s driver: performs the effects an operation or teardown generator yields, translating each one into a ProcessPort call to macOS\'s sandbox-exec and back. The only component that knows both domain effects and infra\'s plain-data shape for this jail type.'
    }
  }
